// FX engine API (RFC 0001 §3.C): firm quotes with a rate lock, and their
// idempotent execution. The gateway and the payment orchestrator call it
// over mTLS; treasury tooling uses the admin service.
//
// Conventions:
//   - Ids are canonical UUID strings; amounts are int64 minor units of the
//     named currency.
//   - ExecuteQuote is idempotent per quote id: retries return the stored
//     execution, and an execution interrupted before its ledger booking is
//     resumed.
//   - Failures carry a google.rpc.ErrorInfo with domain "fx.bilyon" and a
//     reason (EXPIRED, REQUOTE, TAMPERED, NO_ROUTE, FUNDING, ...).

